{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《死有對証》劇情高潮迭起！昨晚（1日）播出一集，張文慈（Pinky）強勢登場，化身被騙財騙色的大馬富婆，對渣男米高（黃俊豪飾）展開痛快淋漓的絕地復仇！Pinky 霸氣惡懲渣男的戲碼，令不少觀眾睇到入晒血，直呼大快人心！</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c8828b33-543e-4ab6-b209-d7f20cceb127.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Ym4835uKPv1790906861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c8828b33-543e-4ab6-b209-d7f20cceb127.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講述「大馬富婆」美娜（張文慈飾）曾慘被米高騙走鉅款與感情，落得人財兩空。一時想不開的她選擇喝天拿水自我了結，幸好執番條命。決心復仇的她苦苦追尋三年，終於在南亞幫的助力下，於瑜伽中心生擒渣男。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">美娜戴上黑超型格登場，用極度沙啞的聲線控訴渣男惡行：「三年唔見，你以為改名換姓我就揾你唔到啊！我從大馬揾你返到香港，你聽到我把聲沙晒，有冇心痛啊！如果你有心痛嘅話，你當年就唔會咁樣對我！」面對米高的瘋狂求饒，早已看穿其真面目的美娜毫不心軟，當場狠狠怒摑對方一巴，並霸氣下令：「係邊個搞到我咁！打到佢死為止！」在成功逼問出3,000萬鉅款下落後，美娜嘴角微微上揚，完美演活了狠戾癲爆的復仇富婆形象。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"320200e0-00e7-4b9d-a787-70e959979895.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Imzt5oWA9z1790906861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"320200e0-00e7-4b9d-a787-70e959979895.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"23a493be-7192-4baf-b92a-fb9245fc2bfa.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264L2jmtrvlh1790906861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"23a493be-7192-4baf-b92a-fb9245fc2bfa.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2e0da597-23e2-4e06-ac6a-7fbc2bf02ad9.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/202675fLmYSKnA1790906861.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2e0da597-23e2-4e06-ac6a-7fbc2bf02ad9.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這場戲除了掌摑情節夠過癮，Pinky 獨特的「沙聲」演繹亦成為網民焦點。張文慈接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時，親自揭開這個神級細節的設計心思。她表示，既然角色曾經喝過天拿水，聲帶必定嚴重受損，絕不能再用正常聲線說話。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">為了完美呈現角色狀態，Pinky 全程刻意用沙啞聲線唸對白：「嗰段時間有嘗試控制把聲講嘢，因為要就住把聲，都會影響啲氣，有啲難度。」她坦言一邊要維持爛聲，一邊還要兼顧角色的憤怒情緒與細微表情，對演技絕對是一大考驗！談到這次的合作，Pinky 亦笑言：「我記得同個靚仔男演員（黃俊豪）做對手，幾有新鮮感。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T02:39:35.772020+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":669,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}